{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人梁烈唯（唯唯）去年夥拍好兄弟林盛斌及陳山聰合演馬來西亞賀歲片《媽媽，又要嫁！</p><p>》，票房不俗，3子曾揚言今年將再下一城，但一直只聞樓梯響。</p><p>然而近日唯唯突然現身當地參與賀歲短劇《食來運轉》開鏡，受訪期間坦言3兄弟合作計劃暫時告吹﹗&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:30.017882+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:54:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.869852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.869852+00:00","content_hash":"562b6f2e5f032556c22af017a2936cae4fdae2af14ce20eac4ad1fa243c252d1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}